# Persian analyzer

The built-in `persian` analyzer can be applied to a text field using the following command:

```json
PUT /persian-index
{
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "content": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "persian"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
{% include copy-curl.html %}

