    },
    {
      "token": "turtle",
      "start_offset": 7,
      "end_offset": 13,
      "type": "<ALPHANUM>",
      "position": 1
    }
  ]
}
```

The duplicate token can be removed by adding a `remove_duplicates` token filter to the index settings:

```json
PUT /index-remove-duplicate
{
  "settings": {
    "analysis": {
      "analyzer": {
        "custom_analyzer": {
          "type": "custom",
          "tokenizer": "standard",
          "filter": [
            "lowercase",
            "keyword_repeat",
            "kstem",
            "remove_duplicates"
